  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing a replicable and scalable MC system for application in ASM CCs in DR Congo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project consortium has developed a Cobalt Credit (CC) system, to provide companies with a channel for meaningful artisan small-scale mining (ASM) engagement commensurate to their cobalt usage. This book-and-claim-based credit system connects downstream actors committed to ensuring the supply of responsibly produced artisanal minerals, with upstream artisanal producers creating credits for purchase for every tonne of cobalt verifiably produced by the cooperative, while downstream actors buy credits commensurate to their cobalt consumption.&#xa0;The project airms to digitise and scale-up the system by enabling and incentivising compliance with international standards for responsible ASM.</narrative>
  </description>
